 ],
 "notes": "The same two-call transcript as vci.authcode.basic.001, with the AS naming private_key_jwt: each client-authenticated POST \u2014 the PAR push and the token exchange \u2014 is preceded by its assertion sign ask, keyed by the registered kid, and carries the assertion members on its form. The pre-authorized grant\u2019s suite-validated assertion (vci.oidf.private-key-jwt.001) is the wire this resume mirrors; the suite has not yet run the authorization-code variant."
}